32
00:02:58,430 --> 00:02:59,280
It's fine.

33
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:01,100
Tell the director about it later.

34
00:03:01,100 --> 00:03:02,500
We can wrap up shooting here.

35
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:04,230
I think we have enough footage.

36
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,070
Okay, let's go.

37
00:03:06,090 --> 00:03:07,790
Kong Fang's stamina—

38
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:12,940
