41
00:03:30,590 --> 00:03:32,240
Speaking of host recommendations,

42
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,190
I still suggest we go with Xiangxiang.

43
00:03:34,190 --> 00:03:36,220
Given how well she knows
the basketball team,

44
00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:38,150
