121
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:48,280
so I rearranged it, and...

122
00:08:48,300 --> 00:08:49,300
Zhou Xiangxiang.

123
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:53,150
Why are you here?

124
00:09:05,010 --> 00:09:06,540
For tomorrow's interview,

125
00:09:06,660 --> 00:09:07,540
didn't you say

126
00:09:08,500 --> 00:09:10,630
