128
00:09:18,690 --> 00:09:20,750
I'm going over the interview script.

129
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,120
Xiangxiang,

130
00:09:26,150 --> 00:09:28,750
how about we go over it
at the station tomorrow?

131
00:09:32,110 --> 00:09:32,870
Sure.

132
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:35,280
I'm heading back to the dorm.

133
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:36,500
See you tomorrow.

134
00:09:36,500 --> 00:09:37,500
See you tomorrow.

