Action.

143
00:10:23,780 --> 00:10:25,770
[Campus Talk
Jiangcheng University Campus TV Station]

144
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:26,480
Laughing at campus life in all its forms,

145
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:28,960
chatting about society's countless scenes.

146
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:30,440
Welcome to Jiangcheng University
TV Station's

147
00:10:29,410 --> 00:10:32,310
[Filming]

148
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,550
monthly program "Campus Talk."

149
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:33,940
I'm your host, Fang Yu.

150
00:10:34,210 --> 00:10:36,010
I'm your host, Zhou Xiangxiang.

151
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:38,200
Today we're honored to invite

152
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,150
two representatives
from the professional youth team,

153
00:10:39,150 --> 00:10:40,960
the Jinhao Basketball Team,

154
00:10:41,030 --> 00:10:42,390
-as well as representatives
-Director, you are biased.

155
00:10:42,390 --> 00:10:43,200
from our Jiangcheng University
Basketball Team.

156
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,390
-You gave such a great opportunity
-Thank you everyone

157
00:10:44,390 --> 00:10:45,320
-to Zhou Xiangxiang
-for tuning in

158
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:45,870
to our show.

159
00:10:45,870 --> 00:10:47,030
-without even letting me know.
-Next to me are

160
00:10:47,030 --> 00:10:48,480
the two representatives
from Jinhao team.

161
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:50,320
Didn't you say you were on leave
the other day?

162
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:52,080
I was only gone a few days.

163
00:10:52,350 --> 00:10:54,510
Then, please introduce yourselves.

164
00:10:54,510 --> 00:10:56,630
Hello everyone, I'm Zhang Fan,
captain of Jinhao Team.

165
00:10:56,630 --> 00:10:57,370
Hello everyone.

166
00:10:57,370 --> 00:11:00,900
I'm Gu Han, captain of
Jiangcheng University Basketball Team.

167
00:11:01,670 --> 00:11:03,360
I'm Li Sirui, vice captain.

168
00:11:03,450 --> 00:11:07,490
[Campus Talk
Jiangcheng University Campus TV Station]

169
00:11:03,910 --> 00:11:06,720
Today we invited these guests here.

170
00:11:06,790 --> 00:11:07,790
What we want to know most,

171
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:08,910
which is also what the fans

172
00:11:08,910 --> 00:11:10,600
are most interested in,

173
00:11:10,730 --> 00:11:13,150
is the difference between
professional basketball teams

174
00:11:13,150 --> 00:11:14,220
and campus basketball teams.

175
00:11:14,220 --> 00:11:16,420
What are your thoughts on this question?

176
00:11:16,020 --> 00:11:17,960
[Campus Talk
Jiangcheng University Campus TV Station]

177
00:11:16,790 --> 00:11:18,510
Starting from middle school,

178
00:11:18,510 --> 00:11:20,550
I was selected into a sports school

179
00:11:20,750 --> 00:11:22,760
and began my path
toward a professional career.

180
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:24,230
Lots of people envy my career,

181
00:11:24,230 --> 00:11:26,290
but I also envy you college students,

182
00:11:26,300 --> 00:11:27,240
getting to play ball

183
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,480
while also pursuing your studies.

184
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:29,840
Actually, I also have a question

185
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:31,440
to ask on behalf of

186
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:33,590
the fans of the Jiangcheng University
basketball team,

187
00:11:33,590 --> 00:11:35,920
for our captain Gu Han.

188
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:37,320
Everyone knows

189
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,910
that in this play-in game,

190
00:11:38,910 --> 00:11:40,120
a big reason we were able to win

191
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:41,840
is that Gu Han brought

192
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,970
Zhou Yunze back to the team.

193
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,280
I want to ask Gu Han.

194
00:11:45,300 --> 00:11:47,450
How did you come up with this idea?

195
00:12:00,970 --> 00:12:03,130
For a long time, everyone thought

196
00:12:03,910 --> 00:12:06,510
that I was carrying
the basketball team alone,

197
00:12:06,850 --> 00:12:08,610
that by my own strength

198
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:10,770
I was leading everyone through games.

199
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:13,200
I used to think so too.

200
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:16,820
And this is exactly why our performance

201
00:12:16,850 --> 00:12:18,890
hasn't improved in three years.

202
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:22,360
It's all because of my arrogance.

203
00:12:24,830 --> 00:12:25,830
Until recently,

204
00:12:27,290 --> 00:12:28,240
I met someone.

205
00:12:32,130 --> 00:12:34,430
While I was helping her pursue her dreams

206
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:35,920
and overcome obstacles,

207
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,290
I was also being healed.

208
00:12:41,780 --> 00:12:46,120
[Filming]

209
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:43,480
She taught me patience,

210
00:12:45,030 --> 00:12:46,030
made me grow,

211
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,240
and made me treat everyone around me

212
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,790
more seriously.

213
00:12:52,450 --> 00:12:53,780
Because of this person,

214
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:56,440
I am a little different from before.

215
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:02,120
[Filming]

216
00:13:02,030 --> 00:13:02,840
Very good.

217
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:04,120
Then I believe

218
00:13:04,270 --> 00:13:06,030
the problems campus basketball teams face

219
00:13:06,030 --> 00:13:08,670
must also come up
in the Jinhao professional team.

220
00:13:08,670 --> 00:13:10,510
I want to ask the captain
of the Jinhao Team.

221
00:13:10,510 --> 00:13:12,080
How would you solve them?

222
00:13:15,140 --> 00:13:17,470
I learned a lot from Senior tonight.

223
00:13:17,490 --> 00:13:18,690
Stage presence

224
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:20,500
is really something we need to work on.

225
00:13:20,500 --> 00:13:21,230
No, no.

226
00:13:21,260 --> 00:13:22,670
It's just from experience.

227
00:13:22,670 --> 00:13:24,870
It happens when you host for a long time.

228
00:13:24,910 --> 00:13:25,750
What do you think?

229
00:13:25,750 --> 00:13:27,510
Aren't the two hosts
of our campus TV station

230
00:13:27,510 --> 00:13:28,840
especially excellent?

231
00:13:30,370 --> 00:13:32,700
Both hosts are very professional,

232
00:13:32,730 --> 00:13:34,440
and as a handsome guy
and a beautiful girl,

233
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:35,960
they make a great pair.

234
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:37,750
No, no, I'm still learning.

235
00:13:37,790 --> 00:13:40,150
Tonight, Xiangxiang and Senior Fang

236
00:13:40,150 --> 00:13:42,000
are simply the best partners.

237
00:13:42,210 --> 00:13:43,210
Not really.

238
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:45,220
Xiangxiang is a newcomer.

239
00:13:45,630 --> 00:13:47,090
She is not a hosting major,

240
00:13:47,100 --> 00:13:47,910
but

241
00:13:48,030 --> 00:13:49,690
her passion is second to none.

242
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:50,840
Actually, Xiangxiang

243
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:52,940
also gave me a lot of inspiration
and motivation.

244
00:13:52,940 --> 00:13:54,270
I also want to thank her.

245
00:13:56,250 --> 00:13:57,400
I should thank you.

246
00:13:57,460 --> 00:13:58,740
You taught me so much.

247
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:03,960
What are you talking about so happily?

248
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:05,480
We were saying that Senior Fang
and Xiangxiang

249
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:06,480
are the best partners.

250
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:07,320
Of course.

251
00:14:08,140 --> 00:14:08,770
Let's go.

252
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:09,960
Director.

253
00:14:10,760 --> 00:14:11,720
Something came up.

254
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:12,720
I'll leave first.

255
00:14:12,900 --> 00:14:14,480
Come on, I already booked a table.

256
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,420
I really have to go.

257
00:14:15,420 --> 00:14:16,210
Sorry.

258
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:19,590
Gu Han.

259
00:14:19,610 --> 00:14:21,890
It's okay. He really has something to do.

260
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:22,800
Let's go eat.

261
00:14:23,730 --> 00:14:25,330
Is everyone here?

262
00:14:25,350 --> 00:14:26,030
All here.

263
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:28,030
Let's go then.

264
00:14:28,050 --> 00:14:28,690
Let's go.

265
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:29,400
Let's go.

266
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,380
Xiangxiang, let's go.

267
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:44,150
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

268
00:14:46,900 --> 00:14:48,930
I'll wait for you on the path
outside the basketball court.

269
00:14:48,930 --> 00:14:50,390
Come over after it's done.

270
00:14:50,870 --> 00:14:52,470
I have something to tell you.

271
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:17,000
[Like a Dream: Dreams like misty rain,
tender gaze, curtain lazily rolled]

272
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:17,510
[Leaning amid blooms, spring has passed.
Who recalls the courtyard by the tower]

273
00:15:40,150 --> 00:15:40,870
Be careful.

274
00:15:45,110 --> 00:15:45,840
Xiangxiang.

275
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:48,880
You did

276
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,550
a great job today.

277
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:53,920
Actually, I was super nervous,

278
00:15:54,110 --> 00:15:56,430
