279
00:15:56,630 --> 00:15:59,090
Good thing you helped me
smooth things over.

280
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:00,520
I didn't expect

281
00:16:00,910 --> 00:16:02,580
our first collaboration

282
00:16:03,030 --> 00:16:04,510
to go so smoothly.

283
00:16:05,040 --> 00:16:06,530
It's been a long time

284
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,080
since I've met

285
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:09,750
such a compatible partner.

286
00:16:10,810 --> 00:16:13,340
After all,
we've known each other for so long.

287
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:34,870
Actually,

288
00:16:36,090 --> 00:16:38,620
I've been thinking about this
for a long time.

289
00:16:44,060 --> 00:16:45,880
I hope you can accept my gift.

290
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:51,360
Senior.

291
00:16:54,630 --> 00:16:55,550
I...

292
00:17:07,770 --> 00:17:09,369
What's going on with you two?

293
00:17:09,589 --> 00:17:11,609
I was wondering why you two left early.

294
00:17:11,609 --> 00:17:12,810
So this is why.

295
00:17:12,869 --> 00:17:13,630
Xiangxiang,

296
00:17:13,660 --> 00:17:15,349
you are the only golden‑partner
Senior Fang Yu has ever acknowledged

297
00:17:15,349 --> 00:17:17,160
in the TV station all these years.

298
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:18,960
I noticed he's been praising you
a lot lately.

299
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:21,690
Turns out he was finding a way
to give you an award.

300
00:17:21,940 --> 00:17:24,119
Senior Fang, are you up for this?

301
00:17:24,190 --> 00:17:25,790
Xiangxiang, just accept it.

302
00:17:27,180 --> 00:17:27,900
Accept it.

303
00:17:27,930 --> 00:17:29,390
-Xiangxiang.
-Accept it.

304
00:17:31,190 --> 00:17:32,110
Accept it.

305
00:17:32,130 --> 00:17:33,020
Accept it.

306
00:17:36,730 --> 00:17:38,050
Thank you, Senior.

307
00:17:46,460 --> 00:17:48,420
Let's go. Don't spoil their moment.

308
00:17:48,420 --> 00:17:49,110
-Yeah.
-Let's go.

309
00:17:49,110 --> 00:17:49,740
We're leaving.

310
00:17:49,740 --> 00:17:50,600
We're leaving.

311
00:17:53,870 --> 00:17:54,480
[Like a Dream: Dreams like misty rain,
tender gaze, curtain lazily rolled]

312
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:55,480
[Leaning amid blooms, spring has passed]

313
00:17:55,430 --> 00:17:56,850
We're heading out, Senior Fang.

314
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:56,480
[Who recalls the courtyard by the tower]

315
00:18:07,940 --> 00:18:08,750
I'm sorry, Senior.

316
00:18:08,750 --> 00:18:10,280
I really can't accept this.

317
00:18:22,830 --> 00:18:23,790
Just now,

318
00:18:25,300 --> 00:18:27,400
you only took it
so you wouldn't embarrass me

319
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:29,260
in front of everyone, didn't you?

320
00:18:36,550 --> 00:18:37,650
Senior,

321
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:42,200
I really appreciate your feelings for me.

322
00:18:44,550 --> 00:18:46,680
Actually, for a long time,

323
00:18:48,400 --> 00:18:50,680
I always thought you were the one I liked.

324
00:18:54,540 --> 00:18:55,890
I really looked forward to

325
00:18:55,890 --> 00:18:59,380
every time you came to journalism class
to share your experience.

326
00:18:59,380 --> 00:19:01,010
And I even secretly went

327
00:19:01,040 --> 00:19:02,500
to watch you host the gala.

328
00:19:04,820 --> 00:19:06,920
But after joining the campus TV station,

329
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:08,750
I had more opportunities
to spend time with you.

330
00:19:08,750 --> 00:19:10,010
That's when I realized

331
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:12,270
that these feelings

332
00:19:12,590 --> 00:19:14,520
were just admiration and respect.

333
00:19:19,090 --> 00:19:20,560
But this feeling

334
00:19:21,110 --> 00:19:22,510
isn't true love.

335
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:29,440
You know what I mean, right?

336
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:32,110
I know.

337
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:34,240
I'm sorry.

338
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:35,030
It's okay.

339
00:19:37,620 --> 00:19:38,620
Actually,

340
00:19:40,530 --> 00:19:43,160
I'm already glad you could tell me

341
00:19:43,590 --> 00:19:45,180
how you truly feel.

342
00:19:53,470 --> 00:19:54,230
Maybe

343
00:19:55,900 --> 00:19:57,760
I didn't think it through myself.

344
00:20:02,040 --> 00:20:02,710
Then,

345
00:20:05,110 --> 00:20:06,360
in the future,

346
00:20:07,110 --> 00:20:09,110
we'll still be good friends, right?

347
00:20:09,620 --> 00:20:10,410
Of course.

348
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:12,650
We will always be good friends.

349
00:20:12,960 --> 00:20:13,610
Okay.

350
00:20:17,300 --> 00:20:18,160
It's a promise.

351
00:20:25,100 --> 00:20:25,790
Let's go.

352
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:35,890
You...

353
00:20:36,280 --> 00:20:37,630
Do you like Le Xiaotao?

354
00:20:39,030 --> 00:20:40,960
I do like her,

355
00:20:40,980 --> 00:20:42,510
but not in the way you think.

356
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:52,210
Why are you back so late?

357
00:20:52,430 --> 00:20:53,400
How did you do?

358
00:20:53,830 --> 00:20:54,680
Not bad.

359
00:20:56,450 --> 00:20:58,780
What about Gu Han?
Did he go to support you?

360
00:20:58,960 --> 00:20:59,680
Yes.

361
00:20:59,700 --> 00:21:01,150
Did he say anything?

362
00:21:03,350 --> 00:21:05,960
He left early before the dinner party.

363
00:21:06,090 --> 00:21:08,290
I didn't even get a chance to talk to him.

364
00:21:12,260 --> 00:21:13,590
Xiaotao, what's wrong?

365
00:21:14,620 --> 00:21:16,820
She's struggling with her assignment.

366
00:21:17,510 --> 00:21:19,750
Xiangxiang, did you finish yours?

367
00:21:33,150 --> 00:21:34,150
I've finished it.

368
00:21:37,920 --> 00:21:40,580
Pathside blooms, light and bright;

369
00:21:40,640 --> 00:21:43,030
Clouded moon, faint and dim.

370
00:21:43,070 --> 00:21:45,310
Spring thoughts, clear and sweet;

371
00:21:45,330 --> 00:21:47,620
Spring God, come back slow.

372
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:48,900
What does that mean?

373
00:21:48,900 --> 00:21:49,770
Explain it.

374
00:21:49,890 --> 00:21:52,210
For example, in the third line,

375
00:21:51,530 --> 00:21:52,330
[Pathside blooms, light and bright;
Clouded moon, faint and dim.]

376
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:53,400
the character "Qing"

377
00:21:52,350 --> 00:21:52,970
[Spring thoughts, clear and sweet;
Spring God, come back slow.]

378
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,960
is a pun on "love".

379
00:21:54,990 --> 00:21:56,510
''Qing'' can mean fine weather,

380
00:21:56,510 --> 00:21:58,160
and also romantic affection,
perfectly poised.

381
00:21:58,160 --> 00:22:00,270
And Spring God,

382
00:22:00,290 --> 00:22:02,850
is also a symbol of beautiful love.

383
00:22:04,890 --> 00:22:07,530
You truly understand my verses, Xinyi.

384
00:22:17,530 --> 00:22:21,650
[Gu Han]

385
00:22:28,320 --> 00:22:28,840
[Gu Han]

386
00:22:28,860 --> 00:22:29,630
[Video call] [Voice call]

387
00:22:29,660 --> 00:22:31,160
[Gu Han]

388
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:41,050
[No answer]

389
00:22:53,270 --> 00:22:56,070
[Gu Han]

390
00:22:54,510 --> 00:22:56,430
Sorry, my phone died.

391
00:22:56,460 --> 00:22:58,390
I just saw your message. What's up?

392
00:23:04,540 --> 00:23:11,100
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

393
00:23:20,710 --> 00:23:23,850
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

394
00:23:26,270 --> 00:23:26,920
Hi.

395
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:31,680
Did you see my WeChat reply?

396
00:23:33,270 --> 00:23:34,880
I told you, my phone died,

397
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:36,110
so I didn't reply.

398
00:23:36,130 --> 00:23:37,230
You were looking for me?

399
00:23:37,230 --> 00:23:37,910
Nothing.

400
00:23:42,540 --> 00:23:44,870
I just wanted to ask about our assignment.

401
00:23:46,090 --> 00:23:48,040
It's about to be checked, right?

402
00:23:48,070 --> 00:23:49,400
If you have any questions,

403
00:23:49,400 --> 00:23:50,920
we can discuss them together.

404
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:52,520
I have something to do later.

405
00:23:54,550 --> 00:23:55,920
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

406
00:23:57,970 --> 00:24:00,260
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

407
00:24:02,570 --> 00:24:03,830
Morning, Xiangxiang.

408
00:24:04,180 --> 00:24:04,790
Morning.

409
00:24:12,590 --> 00:24:13,720
I happen to be free.

410
00:24:13,850 --> 00:24:15,180
How about we have a chat?

411
00:24:15,240 --> 00:24:16,370
Have you had breakfast?

412
00:24:16,370 --> 00:24:17,700
Let's chat while we eat.

413
00:24:22,440 --> 00:24:24,370
Xiangxiang, we're leaving first.

414
00:24:26,200 --> 00:24:27,600
Bai Xue will arrive in a couple of days.

415
00:24:27,600 --> 00:24:29,520
My plan is to let her observe

416
00:24:29,550 --> 00:24:31,150
our regular training first.

417
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:41,290
[Laboratory Building]

418
00:24:40,880 --> 00:24:41,960
Today,

419
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:43,160
we will review

420
00:24:43,160 --> 00:24:45,270
the poetry creations of each group.

421
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:47,590
I need every student to stand up

422
00:24:47,590 --> 00:24:48,830
and recite the poem

423
00:24:48,830 --> 00:24:49,960
they have created.

424
00:24:50,640 --> 00:24:52,670
As long as it shows genuine feelings

425
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:54,210
and a serious attitude,

426
00:24:54,240 --> 00:24:56,070
I think it's a good poem.

427
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:57,680
First, group one.

428
00:24:58,280 --> 00:24:59,230
Le Xiaotao.

429
00:24:59,700 --> 00:25:00,390
Fang Yu.

430
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:04,320
Le Xiaotao, you go first.

431
00:25:07,160 --> 00:25:08,230
-Xiaotao.
-Xiaotao.

432
00:25:08,230 --> 00:25:08,880
Go on.

433
00:25:15,640 --> 00:25:16,440
What's wrong?

434
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:19,070
Sorry, professor.

435
00:25:19,550 --> 00:25:22,590
Inspiration just hasn't come to me lately.

436
00:25:22,610 --> 00:25:24,310
You're a student of this major.

437
00:25:24,310 --> 00:25:25,240
You can't write a single word?

438
00:25:25,240 --> 00:25:26,370
It is unacceptable.

439
00:25:26,960 --> 00:25:28,370
I'll give you two more days.

440
00:25:28,370 --> 00:25:29,660
You must submit this assignment,

441
00:25:29,660 --> 00:25:30,790
or you'll get a zero.

442
00:25:33,840 --> 00:25:34,510
Sit down.

443
00:25:36,430 --> 00:25:37,430
Alright, Fang Yu.

444
00:25:37,810 --> 00:25:39,850
Recite the poem you wrote for Le Xiaotao.

445
00:25:39,850 --> 00:25:40,440
Okay.

446
00:25:44,090 --> 00:25:46,270
Strolling the East Garden,
bathed in evening cool.

447
00:25:46,270 --> 00:25:49,000
Once dear friends lingered
amid faint scents of bloom.

448
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:51,480
Bury old memories deep
within spring's loam.

449
00:25:51,480 --> 00:25:53,480
Cherish and nurture
next February's bloom.

450
00:25:53,480 --> 00:25:54,920
As an elective student,

451
00:25:55,030 --> 00:25:56,550
your understanding of ancient poetry

452
00:25:56,550 --> 00:25:57,440
is very good.

453
00:25:57,830 --> 00:25:59,070
Can you explain to everyone

454
00:25:59,070 --> 00:26:00,510
the meaning of your poem?

455
00:26:01,830 --> 00:26:02,920
The first two lines

456
00:26:03,070 --> 00:26:04,640
are because Le Xiaotao and I

457
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:06,400
have been looking for inspiration
recently.

458
00:26:06,400 --> 00:26:07,600
And the last two lines

459
00:26:07,880 --> 00:26:08,880
are because

460
00:26:08,930 --> 00:26:10,490
I am already a junior,

461
00:26:10,720 --> 00:26:11,980
so I use "old memories"

462
00:26:12,920 --> 00:26:14,050
to describe myself.

463
00:26:14,810 --> 00:26:16,490
And Xiaotao is a freshman,

464
00:26:17,110 --> 00:26:19,750
just like next February's bloom.

465
00:26:20,270 --> 00:26:21,360
It also means I hope

466
00:26:21,610 --> 00:26:22,850
that as a senior student,

467
00:26:22,850 --> 00:26:24,330
I can take more care of her.

468
00:26:26,130 --> 00:26:28,570
Your wording for ''dear friend''
and ''old memories''

469
00:26:28,570 --> 00:26:30,180
comes off a touch plain,

470
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:33,000
but your theme and emotion

471
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:34,270
are very sincere.

472
00:26:34,590 --> 00:26:35,550
I think the idea

473
00:26:35,550 --> 00:26:37,750
of a senior student looking after a junior

474
00:26:37,750 --> 00:26:39,280
is really well‑conceived.

475
00:26:39,350 --> 00:26:40,830
Keep up your good work.

476
00:26:40,830 --> 00:26:42,090
Thank you, professor.

477
00:26:46,310 --> 00:26:46,960
Okay.

478
00:26:47,750 --> 00:26:49,590
Let's have the next group.

479
00:26:51,350 --> 00:26:52,640
Zhou Xiangxiang.

480
00:26:52,960 --> 00:26:54,000
Gu Han.

481
00:26:54,880 --> 00:26:55,790
Then,

482
00:26:56,030 --> 00:26:57,030
Gu Han goes first.

483
00:26:57,510 --> 00:26:58,110
Okay.

484
00:27:08,790 --> 00:27:10,830
In life, true bonds know no age.

485
00:27:11,550 --> 00:27:13,280
Friendship spans the horizon,

486
00:27:15,590 --> 00:27:16,850
beyond the mountains.

487
00:27:18,350 --> 00:27:20,480
I urge you to drink one more cup of wine.

488
00:27:21,300 --> 00:27:23,830
My poetic heart returns
with the bright moon.

489
00:27:26,390 --> 00:27:27,460
Okay, sit down.

490
00:27:28,120 --> 00:27:29,400
This poem—

491
00:27:29,400 --> 00:27:31,060
it feels a bit like
borrowing others' words,

492
00:27:31,060 --> 00:27:32,590
pieced together at random.

493
00:27:32,880 --> 00:27:34,570
But as an elective course,

494
00:27:34,590 --> 00:27:36,670
I think you've taken the first step.

495
00:27:37,350 --> 00:27:39,400
The meaning of this poem

496
00:27:39,430 --> 00:27:40,620
is also quite straightforward.

497
00:27:40,620 --> 00:27:42,150
I believe everyone gets it.

498
00:27:42,950 --> 00:27:44,360
This poem expresses

499
00:27:44,380 --> 00:27:45,710
the sincere friendship

500
00:27:45,720 --> 00:27:46,920
-He's been writing for so long,
-between Gu Han

501
00:27:46,920 --> 00:27:47,920
-yet he's only written this:
- and Zhou Xiangxiang.

502
00:27:47,920 --> 00:27:49,950
Friendship spans the horizon,
beyond the mountains.

503
00:27:49,950 --> 00:27:50,980
Exactly.

504
00:27:51,550 --> 00:27:52,550
Zhou Xiangxiang.

505
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,030
What's going on?

506
00:28:07,160 --> 00:28:08,550
Has no one in our Classical Chinese class

507
00:28:08,550 --> 00:28:10,240
finished their work?

508
00:28:11,510 --> 00:28:12,600
I've finished.

509
00:28:14,070 --> 00:28:14,680
Come on.

510
00:28:19,350 --> 00:28:22,070
Pathside blooms, light and bright;

511
00:28:22,740 --> 00:28:25,590
Clouded moon, faint and dim.

512
00:28:37,080 --> 00:28:40,080
On a summer night beneath the veranda,
joy fills my mind.

513
00:28:37,750 --> 00:28:38,230
[Pathside blooms, light and bright;
Clouded moon, faint and dim.]

514
00:28:38,250 --> 00:28:38,910
[Spring thoughts, clear and sweet;
Spring God, come back slow.]

515
00:28:41,940 --> 00:28:44,380
Gifted to the poet, slowly returning.

516
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:49,640
Gifted to the poet, slowly returning.

517
00:28:49,660 --> 00:28:51,640
The last two lines of Xiangxiang's poem

518
00:28:51,640 --> 00:28:52,590
aren't these, are they?

519
00:28:52,590 --> 00:28:53,540
With this change,

520
00:28:53,540 --> 00:28:55,560
the pun and hidden feelings are all gone.

521
00:28:55,560 --> 00:28:58,070
It just becomes an ordinary poem
for a friend.

522
00:28:58,070 --> 00:28:58,940
Right.

523
00:28:59,920 --> 00:29:00,550
Very good.

524
00:29:00,730 --> 00:29:01,950
Clean parallel couplets,

525
00:29:01,950 --> 00:29:03,330
and beautiful artistic conception.

526
00:29:03,330 --> 00:29:05,680
Come, explain the meaning of your poem.

527
00:29:08,130 --> 00:29:10,800
Recently, I've been creating

528
00:29:12,820 --> 00:29:13,860
with Senior Gu.

529
00:29:15,510 --> 00:29:18,310
We've seen the flowers
by the road together,

530
00:29:18,840 --> 00:29:21,270
and the bright moon in the clouds.

531
00:29:21,660 --> 00:29:23,460
These are all beautiful sights.

532
00:29:24,170 --> 00:29:26,870
So the first two lines describe
the beautiful scenery.

533
00:29:26,870 --> 00:29:28,070
And the last two lines

534
00:29:29,030 --> 00:29:31,790
are about us looking
for poetic inspiration

535
00:29:31,810 --> 00:29:33,240
in the scenery together.

536
00:29:35,680 --> 00:29:36,550
So,

537
00:29:36,880 --> 00:29:39,050
I want to share the beautiful scenery
in my eyes

538
00:29:39,050 --> 00:29:40,050
with

539
00:29:45,820 --> 00:29:47,740
my good friend, Gu Han.

540
00:29:51,310 --> 00:29:53,270
I hope that on his way,

541
00:29:53,270 --> 00:29:54,730
he won't be in such a hurry.

542
00:29:55,270 --> 00:29:57,640
He can cherish it

543
00:29:58,400 --> 00:29:59,860
and feel it with his heart.

544
00:30:01,070 --> 00:30:01,920
Alright, after hearing

545
00:30:01,920 --> 00:30:03,840
Zhou Xiangxiang's explanation...

546
00:30:03,840 --> 00:30:05,100
Please take your seat.

547
00:30:05,630 --> 00:30:07,800
We can truly feel Xiangxiang's

548
00:30:07,820 --> 00:30:09,950
sincere friendship toward Gu Han

549
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:11,270
from this poem.

550
00:30:12,920 --> 00:30:14,610
Okay, next.

551
00:30:14,630 --> 00:30:15,800
Duan Xiaoyu.

552
00:30:18,220 --> 00:30:19,920
When people meet,

553
00:30:20,250 --> 00:30:22,100
the joy lies in getting to know
one another;

554
00:30:22,100 --> 00:30:23,920
When people part ways,

555
00:30:23,950 --> 00:30:25,730
the value lies in having met.

556
00:30:36,050 --> 00:30:37,350
[Pathside blooms, light and bright;
Clouded moon, faint and dim.]

557
00:30:37,370 --> 00:30:38,650
[Spring thoughts, clear and sweet;
Spring God, come back slow.]

558
00:30:47,000 --> 00:30:49,060
I didn't see your message last night.

559
00:30:49,360 --> 00:30:50,800
I'm sorry for holding up

560
00:30:50,820 --> 00:30:52,080
your assignment work.

561
00:31:00,680 --> 00:31:02,040
[Li Sirui]

562
00:31:04,520 --> 00:31:05,270
[Li Sirui] [Call Rejected]

563
00:31:05,520 --> 00:31:07,130
[Li Sirui: 4 missed calls]

564
00:31:15,730 --> 00:31:16,840
[Li Sirui]

565
00:31:22,790 --> 00:31:23,290
[Li Sirui]

566
00:31:23,730 --> 00:31:25,080
[Li Sirui: 6 missed calls]

567
00:31:34,680 --> 00:31:35,510
Are you done?

568
00:31:35,510 --> 00:31:37,070
I told you I'm busy.

569
00:31:37,750 --> 00:31:39,590
Xiaotao, what's wrong?

570
00:31:40,310 --> 00:31:41,440
Senior Zou.

571
00:31:41,960 --> 00:31:44,270
Sorry, I didn't know it was you.

572
00:31:44,290 --> 00:31:45,140
It's fine.

573
00:31:45,310 --> 00:31:46,510
Are you free?

574
00:31:45,980 --> 00:31:51,380
[No Staying Up Late]

575
00:31:46,750 --> 00:31:47,750
Some buddies of mine

576
00:31:47,750 --> 00:31:49,530
opened a shop over on Bar Street.

577
00:31:49,530 --> 00:31:50,640
They asked me to hang out.

578
00:31:50,640 --> 00:31:51,770
Want to go together?

579
00:31:52,570 --> 00:31:54,050
I'm not going.

580
00:31:54,070 --> 00:31:55,200
I'm still doing my homework.

581
00:31:55,200 --> 00:31:57,000
I have to submit it in in two days.

582
00:31:57,130 --> 00:31:59,350
[No Staying Up Late]

583
00:31:57,670 --> 00:31:58,970
Just take it as a chance to relax.

584
00:31:58,970 --> 00:32:00,430
It won't take up much time.

585
00:32:05,240 --> 00:32:06,500
It's at Nightfall Bar.

586
00:32:06,510 --> 00:32:07,800
Nightfall Bar?

587
00:32:11,280 --> 00:32:12,240
Alright then.

588
00:32:12,310 --> 00:32:13,350
See you later.

589
00:32:14,500 --> 00:32:15,100
Okay.

590
00:32:22,030 --> 00:32:23,090
What are you doing?

591
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:27,840
Senior Zou invited me to a bar.

592
00:32:28,240 --> 00:32:30,500
My head is spinning from writing anyway.

593
00:32:30,580 --> 00:32:32,190
I'll just go to clear my mind.

594
00:32:32,640 --> 00:32:34,720
You're still going out this late?

595
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:38,160
Senior Zou isn't a bad guy anyway.

596
00:32:38,160 --> 00:32:39,310
I'll be right back.

597
00:32:41,070 --> 00:32:42,750
You... make sure your phone is charged.

598
00:32:42,750 --> 00:32:43,880
I need to be able to reach you anytime.

599
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:45,880
And don't drink too much.

600
00:32:46,310 --> 00:32:48,230
Don't worry, Mother Zhou.

601
00:32:48,270 --> 00:32:50,200
I promise I'll come back unharmed.

602
00:32:52,560 --> 00:32:53,160
I'm off.

603
00:33:05,960 --> 00:33:07,000
Come on.

604
00:33:07,080 --> 00:33:07,910
Come, drink.

605
00:33:07,930 --> 00:33:08,490
Drink.

606
00:33:10,160 --> 00:33:11,030
You guys,

607
00:33:11,160 --> 00:33:13,150
it's your first time
drinking with Xiaotao today.

608
00:33:13,150 --> 00:33:14,610
Aren't you going to toast?

609
00:33:14,760 --> 00:33:15,920
-Come on, Xiaotao, have a drink.
-Come on.

610
00:33:15,920 --> 00:33:16,650
Have a drink.

611
00:33:16,770 --> 00:33:18,300
Come on, let's have a drink.

612
00:33:18,550 --> 00:33:19,590
It's our first time meeting,

613
00:33:19,590 --> 00:33:21,190
so take it easy on the drinks.

614
00:33:29,300 --> 00:33:30,380
Hey Xiaotao.

615
00:33:30,590 --> 00:33:32,420
Cheng talks about you all the time.

616
00:33:32,420 --> 00:33:33,340
I'm very happy today.

617
00:33:33,340 --> 00:33:34,740
Come, let's have a drink.

618
00:33:34,780 --> 00:33:35,890
Drink.

619
00:33:37,570 --> 00:33:38,120
Come.

620
00:33:38,710 --> 00:33:39,340
Cheers.

621
00:33:44,240 --> 00:33:45,350
Senior.

622
00:33:45,590 --> 00:33:46,310
Eat up.

623
00:33:46,310 --> 00:33:47,480
Come, Xiaotao. Let's have a drink too.

624
00:33:47,480 --> 00:33:48,510
-Come on.
-Nice to meet you.

625
00:33:48,510 --> 00:33:49,590
Come.

626
00:33:49,650 --> 00:33:51,200
Excuse me, I need to go to the restroom.

627
00:33:51,200 --> 00:33:51,920
Okay.

628
00:33:56,830 --> 00:33:57,590
Come on.

629
00:33:57,610 --> 00:33:59,130
-Cheers.
-Come on.

630
00:33:59,230 --> 00:34:00,540
Hey Cheng.

631
00:34:00,560 --> 00:34:01,750
Today is the last day.

632
00:34:01,750 --> 00:34:02,770
Can you win her over?

633
00:34:02,770 --> 00:34:04,700
Can't you see I'm so close?

634
00:34:04,730 --> 00:34:05,860
I think this girl

635
00:34:05,880 --> 00:34:07,470
seems pretty polite to you.

636
00:34:08,380 --> 00:34:09,860
How is that possible?

637
00:34:10,300 --> 00:34:12,300
Who was bragging to us

638
00:34:12,330 --> 00:34:14,340
saying he'd win her over within a month?

639
00:34:14,340 --> 00:34:15,780
This is the last day.

640
00:34:16,030 --> 00:34:17,020
If you lose the bet,

641
00:34:17,020 --> 00:34:18,940
don't forget buying us drinks
for a whole week.

642
00:34:18,940 --> 00:34:20,280
Girls always play hard‑to‑get

643
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:21,909
when they go out.

644
00:34:21,929 --> 00:34:23,239
If she had no interest in me,

645
00:34:23,239 --> 00:34:24,790
would she come out with me this late?

646
00:34:24,790 --> 00:34:26,370
-Come on. Let's drink.
-Come on. Let's drink.

647
00:34:26,370 --> 00:34:27,150
-Cheers.
-You guys,

648
00:34:27,150 --> 00:34:28,480
every single one of you,

649
00:34:28,550 --> 00:34:30,980
if you lose, then all of you go streaking.

650
00:34:31,230 --> 00:34:32,510
Where do you get your confidence?

651
00:34:32,510 --> 00:34:34,969
You think I ordered all these drinks
for fun?

652
00:34:37,710 --> 00:34:38,480
Disgusting.

653
00:34:38,510 --> 00:34:40,440
-You're soaked.
-What's going on?

654
00:34:41,480 --> 00:34:43,409
-What's going on?
-Are you insane?

655
00:34:43,760 --> 00:34:44,510
You are insane.

656
00:34:44,510 --> 00:34:45,150
Say that again.

657
00:34:45,150 --> 00:34:46,230
I said you're disgusting.

658
00:34:46,230 --> 00:34:46,980
How could you...

659
00:34:46,980 --> 00:34:48,040
What are you doing?

660
00:34:53,810 --> 00:34:54,480
Hit him!

661
00:34:54,530 --> 00:34:55,699
Li Sirui!

662
00:34:57,710 --> 00:34:58,510
You dare hit me!

663
00:34:58,510 --> 00:34:59,910
Li Sirui, stop fighting!

664
00:35:00,590 --> 00:35:02,150
-Li Sirui!
-You dare hit me!
